						 <p>Three questions:</p> <ol> <li>Why hasn't Pat given the computer uprising "E-AIDS" yet?</li> <li>How did the computers get hivemind intelligence anyway?</li> <li>Finally, the heck kind of prank is changing my display settings to Korean anyway?</li> </ol> 
